Modification time stamp: 23.07.21-11:25:08
History id: 1.002
Comment:
This is a temporary work around for a compiler problem. The compiler
cannot handle the situation that a header file is included in each
source, so we commented out the #include statements in the source files
and included all sources in the new file dda.c.

