Modification time stamp: 23.07.21-13:27:04
History id: 1.008
Comment:
A. We use now 2 routines to build a list of plays for a ply. Routine
build_ply is called from play_board, routine build_trick is called from
build_tree and hashbackup. The purpose is to modify build_trick to reduce
the number of plays;
B. The card sequences are deleted from 'struct SCARD'. The holding of
each player is now standardised by shifting the cards to use the highest
cards. As a consequence we can use the holding of the players to locate
existing SCARD slots.

